{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/213c4c3f015c38782265899b648e91d3.poster.avif?t=1757724028\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/213c4c3f015c38782265899b648e91d3.webp?t=1757724028\" class=\"bb_img\" width=20 height=20 /></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Dexterity Minesweeper! Sweep Carefully, Aim Precisely!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DexSweeper</strong>, the cursor never stops moving. Use the your <strong>joystick</strong> or <strong>mouse</strong>\u00a0to guide your movement, then time your tile reveals carefully--one wrong move could be your last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/48e9ff7de22d5c3623afe0faf992c93c.poster.avif?t=1757724028\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/48e9ff7de22d5c3623afe0faf992c93c.apng?t=1757724028\" class=\"bb_img\" width=20 height=20 /></picture></span><strong>\u00a0Three Game Modes with Three Difficulty Levels each!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> Mode - Traditional Minesweeper without the crank mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Guess</strong> Mode - Uses the crank but ensures you'll never face a 50/50 guess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong> Mode - The full <strong>DexSweeper</strong> experience, with both dex control and classic Minesweeper strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/82a38761c2464033375095686d856ebc.poster.avif?t=1757724028\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/82a38761c2464033375095686d856ebc.gif?t=1757724028\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode includes three difficulty levels to challenge players of all skill levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner</strong> - A great starting point to learn the mechanics without pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intermediate</strong> - A balanced challenge for experienced sweepers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expert</strong> - The true test of speed, precision, and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/ddeb041efb764bf1f36554201964515a.poster.avif?t=1757724028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/ddeb041efb764bf1f36554201964515a.webm?t=1757724028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/6b7e331328e9969ef704b2b1882bbdfc.poster.avif?t=1757724028\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/6b7e331328e9969ef704b2b1882bbdfc.webp?t=1757724028\" class=\"bb_img\" width=20 height=20 /></picture></span><strong>\u00a0Customize Your Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of tile and cursor options to personalize your experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursors</strong>: 2 animated + 10 static</p></li><li><p clas